E"},"sections":[{"name":"PREAMBLE","text":"RIZATRIPTAN BENZOATE\nphosphate in 1000 ml of water, adjusted top tI7.0\\vi th\nammonia solution., 15 volumes of methanol and\n■' \n15 volumes of acetonitrile, \n''\n- flow rate: 1.5 ml per minute, ' \n■ ,r .\n2- spectrophotometer sei at 215 rim, \n' ..\n- injection volume: 20 pl. \n' \n'\nThe relative retention time with reference to rivastigmine for \nrivastigmine related compound A is about 0.46 arid \nrivastigmine related compound B is about 0.57. ' \n;\nInject reference solution (a) and (b). The test is not valid unless \nthe resolution between the peaks due to rivastigmine related \ncompound A arid rivastigmine related compound B is riot less \nthan 1.5 in the chromatogram obtained with reference solution \n(b), the column, efficiency is not less than 5000 theoretical \nplates, the tailing factor is not more than 2.3 and the relative \nstandard deviation for replicate injections is not more than \n2:0 ’per cent1 in the chromatogram^ obtained with reference \nsolution (a). \n■ ' ■1 ’ \n;\nInject reference solution (a) and the test solution.\nCalculate the content of Ci4H22N2O2 in the capsules.\nl.mg of C14H22N2b2.C4H6p6 is equivalent to 0,6252 mg of \nc14H22N2p2.. ■ j.”.,. \n\"\nStorage. Store protected from moisture, at-_a,temperature not \nexceeding 30°.\nLabelling. The label states the strength in terms of the\nequivalent amount of rivastigmine.\nRizatriptan Benzoate\nC1sHi9N5,C7H6O2 \nMol. Wt. 391.5\nRizatriptan Benzoate is A,A-DimethyI“2-[5-(l ,2,4-triazbl-\nl-ylnicthyl)-1//-indol-3-yl] ethyl amine benzoate. :\nRizatriptan Benzoate contains not less than 99.0 per cent and \nnot more than 101.0 per cent of Ci5Hl9N5, C7H6O2, calculated \non the dried basis.\nCategory. Antimigraine.\nDescription. A white to off white crystalline powder.\nRIZATRIPTAN BENZOATE"},{"name":"Identification","text":"a : -..an?; {-l;\nA. Determine by infrared absorption spectrophotometry (2.4.6). \nCompare the spectrum with,that,obtained;wit